<title>USA: Noranda Aluminum hikes US tag to 86 cents.</title>
<headline>Noranda Aluminum hikes US tag to 86 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noranda Aluminum Inc, part of Canada's Noranda Inc, said its August list price for ingot is 86 cents a lb, up six cents from July.</p>
<p>August's billet price is 96 cents.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
